omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yOmNws_tNLkQ7kNvwGhIEmO&_nc_oc=AdrRv79U7zHlRGNw_KJyzHqSHqrsPgy1vhEiuQrtyM9RVB77sRH5ZmPYcKNYBT8yIF8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3FTuzf4virpX4WOUs_MVa8IOIf2KfsaRehbRF6XraITA&oe=69E4BAF4"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6L_HR1-J1fAQ7kNvwFtk63I&_nc_oc=Adq0pa4to1BExgVNj13mEvkJsPdzq2_qtkM3swT3clilUpbLavoB9EgcuUNuL1pR0co&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0jpG7lb2qhvLps41JVF7oFguhhBa2GkfCaLlYJvUyJxA&oe=69E4BC56"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=y8oTgDErqbYQ7kNvwE4eIx7&_nc_oc=Adrsh-tbgnV5__zCc-jo4N9J6kURDYuFlMo86l8uAoKMARKrcreVmvcLuCjgQwL-eDo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1xcjmocULquw2MwtZ0PL0aOrFuqmmzki5OEgET6Cf50A&oe=69E4D177"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://